# Sorcery of the North (sandoria 83) accepted with the tome already held: the Fei'Yin chest's trade is the chest's own
# script (its loot draw: 5580 gil, CHEST_UNLOCKED); the quest's handler wants no tome held. A chest is placed 10 s after its zone starts
# (hence the tick).
char zone=Feiyin pos=168.7,-24.0,210.8 job=WAR lvl=50
quest Sandoria.SorceryOfTheNorth accepted
keyitem FeiyinMagicTome
item FeiyinChestKey
login
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Chest                    # the chest's own trigger
trade Treasure_Chest FeiyinChestKey x1    # accepted, the tome held: the quest's nil; the chest's own script
tick 4500
